e=\"font-size:12px;\">Duńskie ciasteczka w puszce 150g</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Lindt czekolada mleczna z kawałkami wiśni Amarena - KIRSCH 100g</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Pierniki z Wierzynka 135g</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Mieszanka czekolad z dodatkami 140g</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Niederegger Marcepan Bluebery 100g</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Świeczka Świąteczna </span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Cukierki Lindt</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dekoracja świąteczna</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Pudełko Prezentowe</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Logo firmy /bilecik</span></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:0.36cm;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Konfekcjonowanie</span><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><br /><br /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><strong>Szanowni Państwo,</strong></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:16px;margin-bottom:0.1cm;background-image:none;background-position:0% 0%;background-size:auto;background-repeat:repeat;background-attachment:scroll;margin-top:0.1cm;border:medium;padding:0cm;\"><strong>uprzejmie informujemy, że zdjęcia mają charakter poglądowy. Zastrzegamy sobie prawo do modyfikacji asortymentu w zależności od jego dostępności. Dziękujemy za wyrozumiałość!</strong></p>\n<p></p>",
  "description_short": "<p>Odkryj idealny prezent z naszymi koszami upominkowymi!</p>\n<p>Szukasz wyjątkowego upominku na specjalną okazję? Nasze luksusowe kosze upominkowe to doskonały sposób, aby zaskoczyć swoich bliskich! W selekcji znajdziesz atrakcyjne zestawy, które zachwycą zarówno smakiem, jak i atrakcyjnym wyglądem. Od świąt po urodziny — nasze kosze są idealnym rozwiązaniem na każdą okazję! </p>\n<p>Zamów już dziś i spraw, aby Twoje prezenty były niezapomniane!</p>\n<p></p>",
